1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:05,285
Every scam begins with a message, a link, a QR code, or a voice.

2
00:00:05,285 --> 00:00:08,510
Inside SuSagi: from threat to protection.

3
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:10,403
Zero one: Discover.

4
00:00:10,403 --> 00:00:16,596
Built over four months, SuSagi Guardian organizes defense layers around an on-device core —

5
00:00:16,596 --> 00:00:22,380
uniting URL shields, QR vision, conversational help, speech tools, and incident logs.

6
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:24,363
Zero two: Inspect.

7
00:00:24,363 --> 00:00:31,196
Before a browser loads, Link Shield and QR Vision extract the canonical host and check local indicators.

8
00:00:31,196 --> 00:00:34,679
Intercepted redirects pause at a zero-trust barrier —

9
00:00:34,679 --> 00:00:38,950
confirming destinations before opening India's cybercrime portal.

10
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:43,349
Zero three: Understand.

11
00:00:43,349 --> 00:00:51,548
On ARM64 via ExecuTorch, quantized Llama 3.2 1B and Whisper Tiny INT8 pair with sub-five-millisecond local rules.

12
00:00:51,548 --> 00:00:54,886
An offline greeting proves assistant liveness.

13
00:00:54,886 --> 00:01:01,488
Alongside experimental Agora VoIP scaffolding, Speaker Guard runs a controlled SBI script —

14
00:01:01,488 --> 00:01:06,640
honestly scoring five out of one hundred as threshold tuning continues.

15
00:01:08,180 --> 00:01:09,533
Zero four: Respond.

16
00:01:09,533 --> 00:01:13,663
Call Audit and Threat Logs capture multi-vector evidence —

17
00:01:13,663 --> 00:01:16,439
from UPI requests to raw-IP APK traps —

18
00:01:16,439 --> 00:01:22,990
preparing reports for Helpline 1930 alongside voice diagnostics pending hardware validation.

19
00:01:26,180 --> 00:01:28,176
Zero five: Expand intelligence.

20
00:01:28,176 --> 00:01:37,770
Sensor toggles, a trusted-contact form, local models, regional Indian scripts, and explicit Android permission boundaries keep control with the user.

21
00:01:38,980 --> 00:01:44,620
Intent capture, deterministic screening, ARM64 local AI, and human reporting.

22
00:01:44,620 --> 00:01:45,792
SuSagi Guardian.

23
00:01:45,792 --> 00:01:50,040
Bharat AI-SoC Challenge twenty twenty-six to twenty-seven.

